        rules: {
          objective: 'Chinese 51: Be first to 500+ points by making hands of five cards in one suit (A=11, K/Q/J=10, numeric=face). Japanese 51: Have the highest-scoring hand; sum best suit then subtract other suits; call "Stop!" when satisfied.',
